{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1083668-twin-peaks-ghosts-or-spirits","id":1083668,"title":"Twin Peaks - Ghosts or Spirits?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-25T13:57:56-07:00","id":1083668,"title":"Twin Peaks - Ghosts or Spirits?","content":"<b>Notice: </b>This topic is about metaphysics and main mystery of famous TV series. If you did not watched it, I advised you do binge right now and return when you end 2 seasons of it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> With this month coming 3rd season of <b>Twin Peaks</b> ( after 26 years! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ), I just ended rewatch of 2 seasons and movie <b>Fire Walk With Me</b> - and as one of main inspirations for CoD games, I still have hung ups on the main Mystery of it. Here is to what I come:<br /> <br /> In area where is Twin Peaks now, there are ancient places of good and evil, virtue and vice - called White and Black Lodge. Black one is place where malevolent spiritual beings want to trap people. From some weird reason this place of 'utter sin and evil' is shown as room with red curtains. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> One of the beings that one to run from this Red Room is BOB.<br /> <br /> And now to the topics proper question -<b> In CoD universe, beings from Black Lodge would Ghosts or Spirits?</b> First when seeing what BOB done to girls and how he possessed Leland, I thought he was rather some kind of Lust Spirit. But then other being from Black Lodge are shown - and each and everyone of them looks human. More, beings from Black Lodge want to suck souls and this seems much more 'angry ghost' thing, from what I understand. So what is your interpretation of the topic here. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T14:06:54-07:00","id":1083678,"title":"","content":"Twin Peaks is on my top-ten list of inspiration for spirits in the CofD (as well as inspiration for the CofD in general). Prehuman alien intelligences which intrude into human lives to hunt, feed, and play, whom we perceive in forms that reflect modern human society, but in uncanny, strange ways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-28T02:39:11-07:00","id":1084937,"title":"","content":"Sounds pretty good. So, what would Mark/The one-armed- man be?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>&quot;I am a daydreamer and a Night thinker.&quot;~</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1820-nightout","name":"Nightout","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-28T04:01:31-07:00","id":1084949,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nightout</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1083668-twin-peaks-ghosts-or-spirits?p=1084937#post1084937\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, what would Mark/The one-armed- man be?</div> </div> </div> </div>If beings from Black Lodge are spirits that only look human-like, then Mark would be ex-Urged by the BOB spirit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T00:09:31-07:00","id":1087031,"title":"","content":"Considering the doppelgangers (very goetic in nature), and the duality of good versus evil innate in the Black and White Lodges, I'd look to Inferno.<br /> <br /> The entities of Inferno can be ghosts, spirits, or goetia after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T13:19:57-07:00","id":1095601,"title":"","content":"With new season, I start to have really great inspirations for Spirits to game - Lynch surrealism in season 3 is soooooo visual and stunning. Come to think about it, it seems to drift more and more in to Astral and Goetia regions also. We will see, with half season past us. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-01T23:48:13-07:00","id":1099403,"title":"","content":"There is a new, great compilation of materials from 1-3 episodes of Season 3 showing how <b>Twin Peaks</b> works with like Shadow Realm. In this video, couple is in the Material Realm - and Cooper quickly starts in Twilight of Shadow in the same location. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1-BDU-TvlTg\" data-code=\"1-BDU-TvlTg\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/1-BDU-TvlTg/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T13:03:53-07:00","id":1133127,"title":"","content":"Seeing now all third season till 3 last episodes - I can firmly say it's a story about Shadow Realm being investigated by FBI agents hunters. In episodes 12-15 there are very cool ( and disturbing ) scenes of spirits interactions with Material World... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T14:17:40-07:00","id":1133158,"title":"","content":"All I know is when I saw the Woodsman, I immediately said, &quot;If anyone actually offers him a light, that's his Ban.&quot; It makes me think spirits should in some way display their ban/bane, because it was mythic as heck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","name":"Professor Phobos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T14:44:15-07:00","id":1133170,"title":"","content":"&quot;The owls are not what they seem.&quot;<br /> <br /> I always assumed BOB and his ilk were Strix. (Well, I always assumed the Strix were BOB and his ilk, but what's a little causality between friends?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5695-aceofalmonds","name":"AceOfAlmonds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5695_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"323"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T18:47:27-07:00","id":1133248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AceOfAlmonds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1083668-twin-peaks-ghosts-or-spirits?p=1133170#post1133170\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;The owls are not what they seem.&quot;<br /> <br /> I always assumed BOB and his ilk were Strix. (Well, I always assumed the Strix were BOB and his ilk, but what's a little causality between friends?)</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you seen Season 3 from this year? In Season 1 &amp; 2, I could agree with you that Black Lodge members could be Strix - but unraveling of mysteries in Season 3 points more to Spirits. To Wound-created Spirits of various Corruption, to be precise. They <i>could </i>have started from one Strix - that's why owls imagery is important - but all that's follows is Shadow Realm gone wrong, all along...<br /> <br /> In Season 3 and movie 'Fire Walks With Me' it seems to point that Black Lodge is Shadow Realm Wound, with Corrupted spirits - and White Lodge is Shadow Realm Glade, with 'exalted' spirits. Both 'places' are fighting over Twin Peaks, but White Lode is much more indirect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-23-2017, 09:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}